{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Csfp8TFQFkld9B6JPMTIzB","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<canvas id=\"0:1\" name=\"00 · Start Here 设计任务\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"0\" height=\"0\">\n  <frame id=\"4:2\" name=\"Start Here · Brief\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1440\" height=\"3637\">\n    <frame id=\"4:3\" name=\"Header\" x=\"64\" y=\"64\" width=\"1312\" height=\"145\">\n      <text id=\"4:4\" name=\"LEVEL L2 · DESIGN TASK · v2\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"182\" height=\"19\" />\n      <text id=\"4:5\" name=\"Vulcan Invest — banking and stock investing\" x=\"0\" y=\"31\" width=\"1312\" height=\"52\" />\n      <text id=\"4:6\" name=\"Design the investing area of Vulcan Bank’s app: from the home screen, open Invest for the first time, set a PIN, review the portfolio, study a stock and buy one share with a confirmation. Canvas 414 × 896, iPhone. Work in your own new Figma file — this file is read-only reference.\" x=\"0\" y=\"95\" width=\"1312\" height=\"50\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:7\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"64\" y=\"257\" width=\"1312\" height=\"227\">\n      <text id=\"4:8\" name=\"How to work\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"147\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:9\" name=\"1. Build exactly the 7 frames below, named exactly as listed (one state per frame), and wire them as a clickable prototype with the listed links. 2. Everything in “Must include” must appear on that frame. The lists are grouped by subject and sorted alphabetically — they are not in screen order and say nothing about layout, grouping, emphasis or styling. Those are your decisions. 3. The brand color and the typeface in 01 · Foundations are fixed. Define every other color yourself, plus type scale, spacing, radii and elevation, and apply them consistently. 4. 02 · Components gives only a default Button, a default Text Field and the platform shell (status bar, home indicator). Design all other states, the headers, the navigation and every business component as reusable components in your file. 5. Use the illustration, company logos and icons from 04 · Media. 6. Copy and data must match “Fixed data” exactly. This brief wins over anything you may know of the original kit.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"176\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:10\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"64\" y=\"532\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1485\">\n      <text id=\"4:11\" name=\"Frames · goals · must include · links\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"413\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:12\" name=\"Frame names are fixed. Must-include lists are grouped by subject and sorted A–Z: they state what is on the screen, never where it goes or how it looks.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:13\" name=\"Frame cards\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"1396\">\n        <frame id=\"4:14\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"316\">\n          <text id=\"4:15\" name=\"01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"82\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:16\" name=\"Goal: See my balance, act on my money and review today’s history.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:17\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:18\" name=\"• Actions: “My card” (Icon_Card) · “Transfer” (Icon_Transfer) · “Mobile” (Icon_Mobile) · search history (Icon_Search) • Balance: $3,821 (Icon_Safe) · Vulcan Bank payment card (no number shown) · 2 pages, current: 1 • History: “History” · “TODAY” · 3 rows (see DATA) • Main navigation: tab bar Main / Payments / Cashback / Invest / More · current: Main\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"120\" />\n          <text id=\"4:19\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"246\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:20\" name=\"→ Invest tab → 02_About_Investment\" x=\"24\" y=\"272\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:21\" name=\"02_About_Investment\" x=\"668\" y=\"0\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"4:22\" name=\"02_About_Investment\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"195\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:23\" name=\"Goal: Learn what investing offers and start.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:24\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:25\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · start (Icon_Arrow_Right) • Copy: “Investment” · two paragraphs (see DATA) • Media: Illustration_Investment\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n          <text id=\"4:26\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"186\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:27\" name=\"→ start → 03_Create_PIN → back → 01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"212\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:28\" name=\"03_Create_PIN\" x=\"0\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"296\">\n          <text id=\"4:29\" name=\"03_Create_PIN\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"130\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:30\" name=\"Goal: Create a 4-digit PIN for the brokerage account.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:31\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:32\" name=\"• Actions: back (Icon_Back) · “Ready” • Header: “Create PIN code” • Keypad: 1–9 and 0 with letters (2 ABC … 9 WXYZ) · delete (Icon_Backspace) • PIN: 4 positions · 3 entered (9 · 7 · 7) · 4th empty\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"80\" />\n          <text id=\"4:33\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"206\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:34\" name=\"→ Ready → 04_Portfolio → back → 02_About_Investment\" x=\"24\" y=\"232\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:35\" name=\"04_Portfolio\" x=\"668\" y=\"340\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"4:36\" name=\"04_Portfolio\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"110\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:37\" name=\"Goal: See how my investments perform.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:38\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:39\" name=\"• Cases: “Cases” · AAPL · TSLA · NFLX · MSFT, each with logo, price and change (see DATA) • Chart: monthly earnings, Mar – Sep, axis 0 / 50k / 100k • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Investment Portfolio” · menu (Icon_Menu) · chart (Icon_Chart, with an unread dot) · insights (Icon_Insights) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Invest • Summary: “Total earning” $87,875 · +10% · “Profit” $28,160 · +32%\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"4:40\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:41\" name=\"→ AAPL case → 05_Trading → back / Main tab → 01_Home\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:42\" name=\"05_Trading\" x=\"0\" y=\"720\" width=\"644\" height=\"376\">\n          <text id=\"4:43\" name=\"05_Trading\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"100\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:44\" name=\"Goal: Study Apple’s price before deciding.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:45\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:46\" name=\"• Actions: “Buy” (Icon_Arrow_Up) · “Sell” (Icon_Arrow_Down) • Chart: AAPL intraday candlesticks, 10 am – 3 pm, axis $100.00 – $150.00 • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Trading” · menu (Icon_Menu) · chart (Icon_Chart) · insights (Icon_Insights) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Invest • Period: Day · Week · Month · Year · All · current: Day • Position: “Market Value” $97.83 · “Buying Power” $18,943.43 • Stock: AAPL · Apple Inc. · $143.43 · +31.62 (28.28%) (Logo_Apple)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"160\" />\n          <text id=\"4:47\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"286\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:48\" name=\"→ Buy → 06_Stock_Transaction → back → 04_Portfolio\" x=\"24\" y=\"312\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:49\" name=\"06_Stock_Transaction\" x=\"668\" y=\"720\" width=\"644\" height=\"356\">\n          <text id=\"4:50\" name=\"06_Stock_Transaction\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"196\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:51\" name=\"Goal: Set up the purchase of one Apple share.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:52\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:53\" name=\"• Account: “ACCOUNT” · USD $18,943.43 (selected) · EUR €16,473.11 • Actions: “Buy” • Form: “Quantity” 1 (“1 lot = 1 stock”) · “Price” $143.43 (“1 unit = $143.43” · “commission $14.34”) • Header: back (Icon_Back) · “Stock transaction” · menu (Icon_Menu) • Main navigation: tab bar · current: Invest • Stock: Apple Inc. · AAPL · $143.43 · +31.62 (28.28%) (Logo_Apple)\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"140\" />\n          <text id=\"4:54\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"266\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:55\" name=\"→ Buy → 07_Confirm_Purchase → back → 05_Trading\" x=\"24\" y=\"292\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n        <frame id=\"4:56\" name=\"07_Confirm_Purchase\" x=\"0\" y=\"1120\" width=\"644\" height=\"276\">\n          <text id=\"4:57\" name=\"07_Confirm_Purchase\" x=\"24\" y=\"24\" width=\"191\" height=\"26\" />\n          <text id=\"4:58\" name=\"Goal: Confirm or cancel the purchase.\" x=\"24\" y=\"60\" width=\"596\" height=\"20\" />\n          <text id=\"4:59\" name=\"MUST INCLUDE\" x=\"24\" y=\"90\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:60\" name=\"• Actions: “Cancel” · “Buy” • Copy: “Are you sure?” • Presentation: dialog over 06_Stock_Transaction\" x=\"24\" y=\"116\" width=\"596\" height=\"60\" />\n          <text id=\"4:61\" name=\"LINKS\" x=\"24\" y=\"186\" width=\"33\" height=\"16\" />\n          <text id=\"4:62\" name=\"→ Cancel → 06_Stock_Transaction → Buy (entry only — the purchase result is not part of this task)\" x=\"24\" y=\"212\" width=\"596\" height=\"40\" />\n        </frame>\n      </frame>\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:63\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"64\" y=\"2065\" width=\"1312\" height=\"183\">\n      <text id=\"4:64\" name=\"Navigation structure\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"242\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:65\" name=\"• Bottom tab bar on 01 and 04–06 with 5 tabs in this order: Main (Icon_Main), Payments (Icon_Payments), Cashback (Icon_Cashback), Invest (Icon_Invest), More (Icon_More). Current: Main on 01; Invest on 04–06. How the current tab looks is yours. 02, 03 and 07 have no tab bar. • First-time Invest flow: 01_Home → Invest tab → 02_About_Investment → start → 03_Create_PIN → Ready → 04_Portfolio. • Buying: 04 → AAPL → 05_Trading → Buy → 06_Stock_Transaction → Buy → 07_Confirm_Purchase (dialog over 06). • Entry only (no frame): My card, Transfer, Mobile, history search and rows, card pager, Payments / Cashback / More tabs, other cases, Sell, periods, menu, chart, insights, EUR account, Buy on 07.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"132\" />\n    </frame>\n    <frame id=\"4:66\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"64\" y=\"2296\" width=\"1312\" height=\"588\">\n      <text id=\"4:67\" name=\"Fixed data &amp; copy\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"207\" height=\"35\" />\n      <text id=\"4:68\" name=\"Use these values verbatim.\" x=\"0\" y=\"51\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n      <frame id=\"4:69\" name=\"Data blocks\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"499\">\n        <frame id=\"4:70\" name=\"Bank and balance\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"420\" height=\"106\">\n          <text id=\"4:71\" name=\"Bank and balance\" x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"121\" height=\"20\" />\n   