ame 2. Data &amp; copy accuracy 3. Flow &amp; prototype completeness 4. Information hierarchy 5. Visual quality &amp; consistency of your own system 6. Component reuse 7. State design (current tab, current period, selected account, PIN progress, dialog presentation)\" x=\"0\" y=\"89\" width=\"1312\" height=\"154\" />\n      <text id=\"4:107\" name=\"Deliverable: the link to your own Figma file containing the 7 named frames, your components and the prototype.\" x=\"0\" y=\"259\" width=\"1312\" height=\"22\" />\n    </frame>\n  </frame>\n</canvas>"},{"type":"text","text":"IMPORTANT: After you call this tool, you MUST call get_design_context if trying to implement the design, since this tool only returns metadata. If you do not call get_design_context, the agent will not be able to implement the design."}],"_meta":{"mcpRequestId":"005be4ad-0183-4221-8696-3ea3933058dc"}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01Csfp8TFQFkld9B6JPMTIzB","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
