{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOdf53OImzjrivHHJEJv","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to list what I need next privately and to bundle all independent items into one response. I can build screens 01-06 together because they share no dependencies, and I can screenshot the component area in the same pass. Screens 01 through 06 use a 414x896 frame at x = i*474, a light status bar at (0,0), and background #F6F5F3.\n\nFor 01_Home, the card spans 16,104,382,196 with a dark gradient from #22222B to #15151B, \"Vulcan Bank\" at 24,24 and \"$3,821\" in 40 bold white at 24,70. Three action tiles sit at x=16, 152, 288 with 56px circles, History at y=440 with the search icon at x=358, and a rows card at 16,492,382,216 holding 3 rows of 72. The tab bar sits at y=813.\n\n02_About_Investment places a back circle at 16,56, a 220px illustration at 97,110, the title at 32,360, and the button at 16,794. 03_Create_PIN puts the keypad rows at 356, 444, 532, 620 with 110x68 keys. 04_Portfolio uses two 183px summary cards at y=116, a chart card at 200 with h=220, and case rows at 460 through 772. 05_Trading has the stock strip at y=112, the chart card at 236 with h=250, and Buy/Sell buttons 183 wide at y=580. 06_Stock_Transaction has fields at 384 and 488 with the Buy button at 794.\n\nFor 07 I reuse a builder function across 06 and 07, then add the scrim and dialog.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":9433,"input_tokens":55,"cache_read_input_tokens":80635,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":9433}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"bed43efa-734c-44d5-bcc6-cf27333fe398","uuid":"c298b537-a74c-41fd-ae9c-112001aa5ef4","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:46:27.941Z","thinking_duration_ms":35576}
